│ | Time (s) | Velocity (m/s) | Acceleration ($m/s^2$) | Status        | │
│ | :------- | :------------- | :--------------------- | :------------ | │
│ | 0        | 0              | -                      | At Rest       | │
│ | 1        | 5              | 5                      | Accelerating  | │
